#: ../../source/testing/fabricator.rst:173
msgid "Table Counts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/testing/fabricator.rst:175
msgid ""
"Frequently your faked data will depend on other faked data. "
"``Fabricator`` provides a static count of the number of faked items you "
"have created for each table. Consider the following example:"
msgstr ""

